<title>FRANCE: Filipachi up on Thomson spin-offs talk.</title>
<headline>Filipachi up on Thomson spin-offs talk.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Filipachi Medias rose on Wednesday on talk that it could take control of the communication activities of Lagardere once the latter took over Thomson SA, analysts said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2.71 percent at 1100 francs at 1157 GMT.</p>
</text>
